- Google Gemma 3n (gemma3n:e4b / e2b, optional comparison): Gemma Terms of Use, https://ai.google.dev/gemma/terms
- Google EmbeddingGemma (embeddinggemma:300m): see its official model card / Gemma Terms of Use.

Datasets (downloaded by scripts at set-up time; NOT committed)
- CUAD v1, The Atticus Project, CC BY 4.0. Hendrycks et al., "CUAD: An Expert-Annotated NLP Dataset for
  Legal Contract Review", NeurIPS 2021 Datasets and Benchmarks. Used for evaluation only.
- Open India Law (vaquill/open-india-law, snapshot v2026.08), data CC BY 4.0. Legislation subset used to
  build a local statute-context index. Some upstream sources have unknown terms; the index is generated
  locally and not redistributed.
- India Code (indiacode.gov.in): referenced only through source links shown to users; not scraped or
  redistributed.

Test documents in backend/tests/fixtures are synthetic and written by the LexiShield team.
